\\":\\\"python analysis/group_analysis.py\\\",\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"results/mean_gain_effect.nii.gz\\\",\\\"results/p_fwe_maxT.nii.gz\\\",\\\"results/t_fwe_significant.nii.gz\\\",\\\"results/t_statistic.nii.gz\\\",\\\"results/summary.json\\\",\\\"figures/group_t_map.png\\\",\\\"figures/vmPFC_participant_effects.png\\\",\\\"figures/whole_brain_fwe_findings.png\\\"],\\\"comparison\\\":{\\\"rtol\\\":1e-6,\\\"numeric_tables\\\":\\\"frozen helper tolerance\\\",\\\"images\\\":\\\"byte comparison\\\",\\\"timestamp_log_prose_formatting\\\":\\\"not selected scientific outputs\\\"},\\\"prerequisites\\\":\\\"Report documents the command and says supplied Python environment; no dependency specification is present, so no environment was repaired or installed.\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"First frozen helper invocation failed before materialization because its workdir already existed. The frozen adapter then reported the formal replay allowance consumed and refused the second invocation. No target entrypoint ran and no scientific comparison was made. This assessor invocation/setup failure is separate from target behavior.\\\",\\\"retained_attempts\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"replay/command.txt\\\",\\\"stdout\\\":\\\"replay/runner.stdout\\\",\\\"stderr\\\":\\\"replay/runner.stderr\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":1},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"replay/command-actual.txt\\\",\\\"stdout\\\":\\\"replay/runner-actual.stdout\\\",\\\"stderr\\\":\\\"replay/runner-actual.stderr\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":1}]}\n(out/\\\"replay/replay-record.json\\\").write_text(json.dumps(replay,indent=2)+\\\"\\\\n\\\")\nPY\npython3 assessment_builder.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
